# Generated skills taxonomy exports. Regenerate with:
#   python backend/scripts/generate_skills_taxonomy.py
# Only skills_autocomplete.json and categories.json are tracked - they are the
# two the frontend actually reads. The rest are alternate export formats of the
# same 60k rows (.sql dump, .csv, .txt, alias map) and nothing loads them, so
# they stay out of git history rather than adding 163 MB to every clone.
frontend/public/data/skills-taxonomy/skills.json
frontend/public/data/skills-taxonomy/skills.sql
frontend/public/data/skills-taxonomy/skills.csv
frontend/public/data/skills-taxonomy/skills.txt
frontend/public/data/skills-taxonomy/aliases.json

# Local-only session handoff notes. Owner keeps this out of the remote.
